# The ".env" file is gitignored; copy this file to ".env" if you need to override
# anything locally. Every variable here has a working default, so a fresh clone
# runs with no ".env" at all.
#
# When you add a variable, update the schema in "src/env.js" too — it is
# validated at build/dev time and will fail loudly if the two drift apart.

# Full GraphQL endpoint the browser talks to.
# Default: http://localhost:8080/graphql
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:8080/graphql"
